# The repo-root .gitignore ignores `lib/` (Python packaging/distribution output). That pattern is
# unanchored, so it also swallows this app's hand-written src/lib utilities (logger, sse-events,
# format, ...) that many modules import. Re-include that source directory.
!src/lib/
!src/lib/**
.vite/
